{"2884840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Angel", "steam_appid": 2884840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884840/extras/89a98051355ee37c9dc5ca3f77fe02f3.avif?t=1787262684\" width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884840/extras/9d71cea1f3efccd1e042b46b478cc286.avif?t=1787262684\" width=1360 height=408 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884840/extras/51e5f6a032a11e0c0b182aa4c10bdbe6.poster.avif?t=1787262684\" width=646 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884840/extras/51e5f6a032a11e0c0b182aa4c10bdbe6.webm?t=1787262684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884840/extras/51e5f6a032a11e0c0b182aa4c10bdbe6.mp4?t=1787262684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in ANGEL, a rhythm racing adventure, where digital climate change threatens the <strong>eCho</strong> network with extinction. Propel through digital landscapes, crafting new break beats to infuse a stagnating network with the spark of renewal. ANGEL imbues the flow state of racing with the complexity of breakbeat music to redefine arcade and combo-based gameplay, enhanced by a soundtrack from MyraTV, and many other breakbeat enthusiasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As eCho faces its extinction, the ANGEL protocol - <strong>EXPLORE, CREATE, REFLECT</strong>- persists. Embark on a journey that questions what it means to be connected. </